<section className="wokFund"><div><span>FUEL THE FUTURE</span><h2>Fund women-led knowledge, research and practical adaptation.</h2><p>Your investment directly supports the expansion of WoK—Action research, documentation and skills training.</p></div><a href={WOK_FUND} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" className="pill lime">Open funding portal <ArrowUpRight size={17}/></a></section>
